# Android Embedded Photo Picker Bridge

When implementing or fixing the Android gallery bridge, follow the full copy-paste prompt in `docs/cursor-prompt-android-embedded-photo-picker.md`.

## Rules

- **Android only** — do not change iOS CameraRoll grid or photos permission flow
- **Play compliant** — no `READ_MEDIA_IMAGES` / `READ_MEDIA_VIDEO`; API 33+ storage checks auto-grant for picker flows
- **Primary path** — `androidx.photopicker.EmbeddedPhotoPickerView` via `EmbeddedPhotoPickerViewManager`
- **Fallback** — `react-native-image-picker` system picker when `isEmbeddedPhotoPickerAvailable()` is false
- **UX** — keep location banner, thumbnail preview, and Next → crop pipeline on the gallery screen

## Native pitfalls

- `@OptIn(ExperimentalPhotoPickerApi::class)` + `-opt-in=androidx.photopicker.ExperimentalPhotoPickerApi`
- `EmbeddedPhotoPickerSession` from `android.widget.photopicker` (not nested on View)
- `setAccentColor(Long)` — convert React color int with `toLong() and 0xFFFFFFFFL`
- `setMaxSelectionLimit(1)` on `EmbeddedPhotoPickerFeatureInfo.Builder`

## Key files (this repo)

- Native: `android/app/src/main/java/com/trackzio/mushrooms/EmbeddedPhotoPicker*.kt`
- JS: `src/features/camera/components/EmbeddedAndroidPhotoPicker.tsx`, `screens/GalleryPickerScreen.tsx`
- Docs: `docs/android-embedded-photo-picker-bridge.md`
